  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a welcoming touch to any classroom, featuring a modern composition notebook style. Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, it combines aesthetic appeal with practical functionality, making it a special addition to educational environments.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalized with a teacher’s name for a unique touch</li>\n<li>Soft and durable non-woven fabric top for comfort</li>\n<li>Neoprene rubber non-slip backing for stability</li>\n<li>Effectively dries wet feet and traps dirt and grime</li>\n<li>Suitable for classrooms, entryways, and RVs</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Teacher, Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy, Neoprene Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down, sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is perfect for creating a warm and inviting atmosphere in classrooms, school entryways, or even personal RVs. It serves as an excellent decorative and functional piece for educational settings.</p>",
